			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-689960">
									

<p>Copy-and-pasting has already been addressed — see Test 48. It wouldn't make particularly useful D-class, methinks. I'm also reluctant to expand these testing logs much more. Brevity is the soul of creepiness, and I think I'm already pushing it.</p>
<p>That said, between this comment and Leicontis' re:porn, I think I may have to address what happens when you pull a living organism or a live recording out of 713. (No, it will not be porn.) The challenge will be to do it properly in as few test logs as possible…</p>

